stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> backlog: created
    backlog --> in_progress: drag (no deps unmet)
    backlog --> in_review: drag
    backlog --> done: ONLY if all deps done
    in_progress --> in_review: drag
    in_progress --> done: ONLY if all deps done
    in_progress --> backlog: drag back
    in_review --> done: ONLY if all deps done
    in_review --> in_progress: drag back
    in_review --> backlog: drag back
    done --> backlog: revert (cascades to dependents)
    done --> in_progress: revert (cascades to dependents)
    done --> in_review: revert (cascades to dependents)
    done --> [*]: deleted
    backlog --> [*]: deleted
    in_progress --> [*]: deleted
    in_review --> [*]: deleted
